== Conflicting prayers ==
Not all prayers may be active at once. When enabling a prayer while having conflicting prayer(s) already active, the active prayer(s) will be disabled and only the clicked prayer will be active. Most prayers are in a conflict group.

The only prayers without conflicting prayers, and thus can always be activated, are:

{{Plink|Rapid Restore}}, {{Plink|Rapid Heal}}, {{Plink|Protect Item}}, and {{Plink|Preserve}}.
